<title>UK: IBM sets 15 bln drachma bond due Feb 2002.</title>
<headline>IBM sets 15 bln drachma bond due Feb 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IBM INTERNATIONAL FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORP</p>
<p> AMT     15 BLN GRD   COUPON     9.45	MATURITY    28.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.644   PAY DATE    28.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.069   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   DENOMS (M) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/GB/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
